<title>UK: KfW unit sets 10 billion peseta 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets 10 billion peseta 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER  KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR KREDITANSTANLT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    29.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.61    PAY DATE    29.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
